WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.660
What the government can't tolerate is basically having large denomination notes on steroids.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:13.500
It can't allow people to make large transactions easily, across borders-

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.660
I think we need to worry about the privacy of those of us who use hundred dollar bills and bitcoin.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.980
It's not right to assume that we're all criminals

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.260
and therefore need to have these things taken away from us.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:29.240
What the Federal Reserve and other central banks do is reverse money laundering.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.500
Money laundering takes dirty money and makes it clean,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.200
they take clean money and it ends up being dirty.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:44.000
So when banking services are shut off for people who are doing legal and harmless business.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.440
Cash is a badge of freedom.

